  "purpose" : "(Clinical Focus: This value set includes concepts representing ethnicity as defined in the CDC Race and Ethnicity (CDCREC) code system. It also includes concepts for cases where ethnicity is unknown, the individual does not know, or the individual declined to respond.),(Data Element Scope: Concepts representing ethnicity from the CDCREC code system, excluding the two primary ethnicity category concepts (Hispanic or Latino, Not Hispanic or Latino), and including concepts representing reasons why ethnicity was not collected.),(Inclusion Criteria: Descendant concepts of 2133-7 Ethnicity from the CDC Race and Ethnicity (CDCREC) code system are included, along with concepts indicating when ethnicity is unknown, not known by the individual, or when the individual declined to respond.),(Exclusion Criteria: CDCREC concepts 2133-7 (Ethnicity), \n2135-2 (Hispanic or Latino) and 2186-5 (Not Hispanic or Latino))",
